{"id":"d9178a1638731beb","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-predicative-impredicative.md","title":"预测性与非预测性","display":"df-predicative-impredicative — 预测性与非预测性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-predicative-impredicative","aliases":["91-df-predicative-impredicative","91-df-predicativity","91-df-impredicativity-truth"],"display":"df-predicative-impredicative — 预测性与非预测性","depends_on":["[[91-df-ordinal-analysis]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-predicative-impredicative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-predicative-impredicative</span><span>91-df-predicativity</span><span>91-df-impredicativity-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-predicative-impredicative — 预测性与非预测性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99cc98508e51c9ee\" href=\"?note=99cc98508e51c9ee\" title=\"91-df-ordinal-analysis\">91-df-ordinal-analysis</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-predicative-impredicative-—-预测性与非预测性-$\\mathrm{PredImpr}$\">df-predicative-impredicative — 预测性与非预测性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PredImpr}\">\\(\\mathrm{PredImpr}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (某个形式定义的句法编码)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> (该定义引入的对象)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> (候选量化总体)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\\)</span> (编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的被定义项是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D)\">\\(\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D)\\)</span> (编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 的定义式含有论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的量词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land a\\in D\n\\land\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land a\\in D\n\\land\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预测性 : 定义不涉及自身</li>\n<li>非预测性 : 定义可能涉及自身</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>：定义时被当作已经给定的总体</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预测性 vs 非预测性：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>预测性理论</th>\n<th>非预测性理论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>定义依赖</td>\n<td>不量化包含待定义对象的未先给总体</td>\n<td>量化包含待定义对象的总体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序数分析</td>\n<td>可提供某种强度校准</td>\n<td>不能替代定义依赖分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哲学立场</td>\n<td>Poincaré、Russell偏好</td>\n<td>现代逻辑接受</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>把整个理论称为预测性或非预测性，还要指定允许的构造原则、定义层级和背景本体论。单凭“有类型/无类型”或一个未经证明的序数值不能完成分类。</p>\n<p>预测性的历史背景：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>人物</th>\n<th>立场</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Poincaré</td>\n<td>拒绝非预测性定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Russell</td>\n<td>恶性循环原则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weyl</td>\n<td>预测性分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feferman</td>\n<td>系统化预测性界限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>预测性与真理理论的关系：\n预测性与自指、悖论容忍度和语法保守性是不同维度；它们之间没有上述无条件蕴涵。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span>作为预测性界限：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 是传统 Feferman–Schütte 分析中的重要基准，但“预测性”的哲学与技术刻画存在争议，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal T|\\le\\Gamma_0\">\\(|\\mathcal T|\\le\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 当作定义性充要条件。</p>\n<p>预测性的哲学意义：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>意义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>预测性定义被视为&quot;安全&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环性</td>\n<td>非预测性可能涉及&quot;恶性循环&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现代接受</td>\n<td>多数学者接受非预测性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解真理理论的预测性界限</li>\n<li>区分预测性与非预测性真理理论</li>\n<li>分析<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span>作为界限的哲学意义</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-predicative-impredicative-—-预测性与非预测性-$\\mathrm{PredImpr}$","text":"df-predicative-impredicative — 预测性与非预测性 $\\mathrm{PredImpr}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-ordinal-analysis","status":"resolved","id":"99cc98508e51c9ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ordinal-analysis]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PredImpr}","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}predicative\\text{-}impredicative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land a\\in D\n\\land\\operatorname{QDom}(d,D),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pred}_D(d,a)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Defines}(d,a)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Impred}_D(d,a).","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal T|\\le\\Gamma_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_0","display":false}],"bytes":2703,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-predicative-impredicative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global